# Optional environment overrides for My Daemon.
#
# Your ANTHROPIC_API_KEY does NOT belong in this file. Run `daemon setup` and it
# is stored in the OS credential store instead — Windows Credential Manager,
# macOS Keychain, or Linux Secret Service — encrypted at rest rather than
# sitting in plaintext on disk. `daemon setup` also strips any key it finds in
# a .env left over from an older install.
#
# Any config.yaml value can be overridden here using the MY_DAEMON_ prefix and
# double-underscore nesting, for example:
#
# MY_DAEMON_LLM__MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-6
# MY_DAEMON_GRAPH__EXPANSION_DEPTH=3
